                    margin-left: auto;">
                    
Dear {!Contact.FirstName},  <br /><br />

We have stopped mailing cards for on-campus students as online requests will not be processed in time for the first day of classes. You will need to pick up your card at one of the Sun Card Office locations.  Please click <a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/cardservices#fees-and-location">here</a> for locations and hours of operation. <br /><br />

<b>Sun Cards cost $25.00</b> and can be purchased with cash, Visa /Mastercard, or be billed to your ASU Student Account. <i>Cash is only accepted at the Tempe location. </i><br /><br />

You will need to have your <b>student ID number</b> and a <b>government issued ID</b> available when you visit our office. <i>Government issued ID may include: US driver’s license, US passport, US visa. </i><br /><br />

Regards,<br />

 {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
